644703"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p011","text":"湯崩，太子太丁未立而卒，於是迺立太丁之弟外丙，是為帝外丙。帝外丙即位三年，崩，立外丙之弟中壬，是為帝中壬。帝中壬即位四年，崩，伊尹迺立太丁之子太甲。太甲，成湯適長孫也，是為帝太甲。帝太甲元年，伊尹作伊訓，作肆命，作徂后。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m_e0h","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"太丁","kind":"person","person_id":"tlt_5h1_n6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"太丁","kind":"person","person_id":"tlt_5h1_n6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"odj_0jk_o2z","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"帝外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"odj_0jk_o2z","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"帝外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"odj_0jk_o2z","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"odj_0jk_o2z","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"中壬","kind":"person","person_id":"t3y_v2v_ipe","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"帝中壬","kind":"person","person_id":"t3y_v2v_ipe","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"帝中壬","kind":"person","person_id":"t3y_v2v_ipe","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"太丁","kind":"person","person_id":"tlt_5h1_n6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"成湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m_e0h","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0086","start":86,"end":89,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0090","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"}],"annotation_status":"in_progress","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p012","text":"帝太甲既立三年，不明，暴虐，不遵湯法，亂德，於是伊尹放之於桐宮。三年，伊尹攝行政當國，以朝諸侯。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m_e0h","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"}],"annotation_status":"in_progress","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p013","text":"帝太甲居桐宮三年，悔過自責，反善，於是伊尹迺迎帝太甲而授之政。帝太甲修德，諸侯咸歸殷，百姓以寧。伊尹嘉之，迺作太甲訓三篇，襃帝太甲，稱太宗。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"太宗","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"}],"annotation_status":"in_progress","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p014","text":"太宗崩，子沃丁立。帝沃丁之時，伊尹卒。既葬伊尹於亳，咎單遂訓伊尹事，作沃丁。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"太宗","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"沃丁","kind":"person","person_id":"t5l_nxu_k7z","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"帝沃丁","kind":"person","person_id":"t5l_nxu_k7z","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"咎單","kind":"person","person_id":"0h0_68r_si5","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"source_identified"}],"annotation_status":"in_progress","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r003-c00","column":0,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"帝太甲，故太子太丁子。淫，伊尹放之桐宮。三年，悔過自責，伊尹乃迎之復位。","source_row":3,"source_column":1,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r003-c00-m000","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"太甲","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉殷王世系與《殷本紀》暫定同指；湯子太丁與武乙子太丁分別辨認。"},{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r003-c00-m001","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"太丁","person_id":"tlt_5h1_n6y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉殷王世系與《殷本紀》暫定同指；湯子太丁與武乙子太丁分別辨認。"},{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r003-c00-m002","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"伊尹","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉殷王世系與《殷本紀》暫定同指；湯子太丁與武乙子太丁分別辨認。"},{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r003-c00-m003","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"伊尹","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉殷王世系與《殷本紀》暫定同指；湯子太丁與武乙子太丁分別辨認。"}],"table_id":"shiji-013","table_fragment_id":"shiji-013-digital-table-2","table_row_id":"shiji-013-t2-r003","table_cell_id":"shiji-013-t2-r003-c00","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-013","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-013","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-013","source_revision":"2606991","source_header":[""],"row_year":null}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-099","source_id":"s-jinshu-099-huanxuan-ws2644703","source":{"provider":"Wikisource","revision_id":2644703,"permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷099&oldid=2644703","edition":null,"image_verified":false,"qualification":"固定數位傳世文字見證；未親核底本或影像，校勘ref另層。","selected_raw_start":205,"selected_raw_end":10419,"extent":"完整選定傳記單元 huanxuan；非全書、非全卷","rights":"古代正文公版；維基文庫數位整理保留來源歸屬及CC BY-SA資格。","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"Balanced wiki display p